{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17144","headline":"赐耆老布帛 · 崔枢","name":"赐耆老布帛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殊私及耆老，圣德赈黎元。\n布帛忻天赐，生涯作主恩。\n情均皆挟纩，礼异贲丘园。\n庆洽时方泰，仁沾月告存。\n宁知酬雨露，空识荷乾坤。\n击壤将何幸，裴回望九门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔枢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}